{"des":"格薇勒-醉酒幻梦","script":"yd_028_10","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"x":170,"trans":true,"y":-530,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":170,"trans":true,"y":-530,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]生活这么苦……还是让自己喝醉的时候比较舒服啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]能短暂地遗忘生活中的烦恼，沉浸在迷离的幻梦中。[r]这种感觉真的非常棒……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]虽然醒来之后一切都要回归正常，我也要做回大家眼中那个熟悉的格薇勒。[r]但是偶尔体验一下这种放纵的感觉，才能让我感觉自己还是活着的人……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"格薇勒","text":"[show]什么？你问我喝醉了吗？[r]没有……我只是发发牢骚而已……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara028_0","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":170,"trans":true,"y":-530,"noOut":false,"addImg":"","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}